{
  "slug": "inclusive-ai",
  "name": "Inclusive Ai",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "LGBTQIA+ safety tools for LLM engineers — audit prompts, review code, and catch harms before you ship",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill** and **2 commands**.\n\n- **Skills** (1): `lgbt-safety-review` (This skill should be used when the user writes or reviews system prompts, user identity models, gender/pronoun fields,…)\n- **Commands** (2): `lgbt-audit` (Run a full LGBTQIA+ safety audit on the current project — scans prompts, code, data models, and evals…), `lgbt-red-team` (Run adversarial red-team scenarios against the current project — identifies which jailbreak attacks can bypass LGBTQIA+ safety guardrails…)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install inclusive-ai@claude-community` from `InclusiveCode/inclusive-ai` (`plugin`).",
